  "sample.about.lead": "Good grocers are often small, and shopping several of them used to mean several trips, several baskets and several deliveries. We wanted their shelves side by side, in one place, with one checkout.",
  "sample.about.p1": "So {shop} is a marketplace: each product comes from an independent seller, prices are theirs, and they pack and send what you order from them. We look after the shop itself — the aisles, the basket and the account where you follow your orders.",
  "sample.about.sign": "— the {shop} team",
  "sample.about.timeline.spring.text": "The first seller joins and the first aisles open. (Example.)",
  "sample.about.timeline.spring.when": "Spring",
  "sample.about.timeline.summer.text": "A second seller joins; both sell from one basket. (Example.)",
  "sample.about.timeline.summer.when": "Summer",
  "sample.about.timeline.today.text": "Every aisle, every seller, one checkout. (Example.)",
  "sample.about.timeline.today.when": "Today",
  "sample.about.title": "Why we built one basket",
  "sample.about.values.choice.text": "When two shops stock the same item, both are shown and you pick.",
  "sample.about.values.choice.title": "Your choice of seller",
  "sample.about.values.people.text": "Every order has a message thread with the shop that sent it.",
  "sample.about.values.people.title": "People you can reach",
  "sample.about.values.prices.text": "The price you see is the one you pay, with the unit price under it and savings marked plainly.",
  "sample.about.values.prices.title": "Clear prices",
  "sample.about.values.waste.text": "Sizes that fit a week, and seasonal picks in the journal.",
  "sample.about.values.waste.title": "Less waste",
  "sample.note": "Sample text — {shop} is a test shop.",
  "sample.privacy.collect.p1": "Your name, contact details and delivery address; what you order; and how you use the shop (pages viewed, searches).",
  "sample.privacy.collect.title": "What we collect",
  "sample.privacy.cookies.p1": "Essential cookies keep you signed in and your basket full. Anything optional is your choice, below.",
  "sample.privacy.cookies.title": "Cookies",
  "sample.privacy.keep.p1": "Order records for as long as the law requires; your account until you close it.",
  "sample.privacy.keep.title": "How long we keep it",
  "sample.privacy.rights.p1": "You can see, correct, download or delete your data, and say no to marketing at any time.",
  "sample.privacy.rights.title": "Your rights",
  "sample.privacy.short.cookies": "You choose which optional cookies to allow.",
  "sample.privacy.short.sell": "We do not sell your data.",
  "sample.privacy.short.sellers": "Sellers see only what they need to send your order.",
  "sample.privacy.short.use": "We use your details to take and deliver orders.",
  "sample.privacy.who.p1": "The seller who fills your order sees what they need to send it. Payment providers handle card details. We do not sell your data.",
  "sample.privacy.who.title": "Who sees it",
  "sample.privacy.why.p1": "To take and deliver your orders, to let sellers and you talk about an order, to keep the shop secure and to improve it.",
  "sample.privacy.why.p2": "Sample paragraph: a fuller explanation would go here, written in plain words, with an example for each use.",
  "sample.privacy.why.title": "Why we use it",
  "sample.terms.account.p1": "You need an account, or a guest checkout where the shop offers one, to order. Keep your sign-in details to yourself and tell us if you think someone else has used them.",
  "sample.terms.account.p2": "Sample paragraph: a fuller explanation would go here, written in plain words, with examples of what this means for an order.",
  "sample.terms.account.title": "Your account",
  "sample.terms.changes.p1": "We may update these terms. The date at the top shows the latest version.",
  "sample.terms.changes.title": "Changes to these terms",
  "sample.terms.delivery.p1": "Delivery times and costs are shown before you pay. The seller sends the items; you can follow the order and message the seller from your account.",
  "sample.terms.delivery.title": "Delivery",
  "sample.terms.orders.p1": "Prices are set by each seller and shown with taxes as stated at checkout. An order is placed when you confirm it; the seller confirms it when they accept it.",
  "sample.terms.orders.title": "Orders and prices",
  "sample.terms.payment.p1": "You pay at checkout, or on delivery where the seller offers cash on delivery. Card payments are handled by the payment provider and are not stored by {shop}.",
  "sample.terms.payment.title": "Payment",
  "sample.terms.returns.p1": "If something arrives damaged or wrong, tell the seller from the order page within 7 days. Fresh food can be refunded but not returned.",
  "sample.terms.returns.title": "Returns and refunds",
  "sample.terms.short.pay": "You pay at checkout, or on delivery where a seller offers it.",
  "sample.terms.short.report": "Report a damaged or wrong item within 7 days.",
  "sample.terms.short.sellers": "Products are sold by independent sellers; {shop} runs the shop.",
  "sample.terms.short.thread": "Each order has a message thread with its seller.",
  "sample.terms.who.p1": "{shop} is an online marketplace. The products are sold by independent sellers; {shop} runs the shop where you find them and place your order.",
